{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1000_051tmg", "source_sha256": "63f69adc3d88ce2e11ba79466e415ccaca98111908f4037f98668cd815145293", "ja": "そんな、松田さんがまだまだなんて。\nおふたりに比べたら、うちは……。", "zh": "怎么会，松田小姐还差得远什么的。\n要是和你们两位相比，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "2201f6a1154325430f5b366add8ee82b783e843b3cca0ed781a7fce60c444285", "ja": "ええっ、何言ってるんですか～！　近ごろの\n紬ちゃんの活躍ぶり、ありさは知ってますよ！", "zh": "诶——，您在说什么呀～！最近小紬活跃的表现，亚利莎可是都知道哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "ccff18ed538116cf6c6baa47eb4023808687262f0db12c3114adc636408dad15", "ja": "ほら、見てください！　ちょうど整理しようと\n思っていたお宝写真が、ここにっ！", "zh": "您看，请看！正好是我打算整理的珍贵照片，就在这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "267be622703267cbf5e2f037926789c7ad5fac359ade1f98e48a0eb3cdebbc3c", "ja": "えっ……これ、全部うちなん……？\nこ、こんなにたくさん、いつの間に……！", "zh": "诶……这些……全都是我的……？\n这、这么多，到底是什么时候……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "46cb04311e3454260f5f83fa68bfe4ae17eba28d91ef7a62163d9c3913699a9c", "ja": "ふふ、よく撮れていますね。……これは、\nでびゅーしたばかりの頃の紬でしょうか。", "zh": "呵呵，拍得真不错呢。……这是刚出道时的纺吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "22ab0bc2d97e552de6af737cfb4b304bb674f31db36547bd3ff9d7ac74b1bb86", "ja": "大正解ですっ！　今の紬ちゃんも最高ですけど、\n初期の紬ちゃんの初々しさもまた……ムフフ♪", "zh": "完全正确！现在的紬也很棒，\n不过刚出道时紬那种青涩的感觉也……嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1006_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6682e6c9c39ca9dcfb19c20e9382fb657a4377f9355fd50467120cc2ac6823c8", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様。\n……なんだか盛り上がってるな？", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n……感觉气氛挺热烈的啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "3a5fb26dbe64483e27e8cb9dc0dc433511c8d5967655331667984ea9f8b6ebcf", "ja": "ふっふっふ……{$P$}さん、\n見てください！　この紬ちゃんのお宝写真の数々を！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……{$P$}先生，快看！这些都是紬的珍贵照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "817f2108a38d5609bd478a153e291a69f681258346d5fb9f3f626759ee5a0ae0", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと松田さん！", "zh": "等、等一下，松田小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "92535a9d4cd7ccc6b3f5372212745ea2ad69f49cc9f0593934ea32dce7981f8a", "ja": "どれどれ、紬の写真？　すごい量だね！\nあ、アタシたちもちょっと写ってるじゃん。", "zh": "我看看，这是紬的照片？数量真多啊！\n啊，我们也稍微入镜了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "1539093db61ac9919ff6b514a8505df60ac655c65bc5b1f3b7a35f3b89463dd3", "ja": "わぁ……亜利沙さん、やっぱり写真上手なんだねぇ。\nどの紬さんも、綺麗に撮れてるよぉ。", "zh": "哇……亚利沙拍照片果然很厉害呢。\n每张紬拍得都很漂亮哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1ed54be3cdd663492b1dd7a23c434425ef99942cdad431a0fa22f7aa21363d1f", "ja": "あ、あの。みなさん、もうその辺で……。", "zh": "啊，那个……大家就先到此为止吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d79cd2c97178553134e10eadc744b1edbfe05c22f3bf04d607f5a9255a8876c4", "ja": "へぇ、なんだか懐かしい写真が多いな。\nこれなんか、デビューした直後の……。", "zh": "嘿，感觉有好多令人怀念的照片啊。\n这张好像是刚出道不久时的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f33c1367b8daa74cc1df64124813571d7277b473928330ae3d7f9a39285d7a98", "ja": "あ、あなたは、写真を見にここに来たのですか！？\n私は、仕事の話があると聞いていたのですが。", "zh": "啊，原来您是来看照片的吗！？\n我还听说是有工作的事要谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cd860871f15a7c6a24decc3e5cc45168d44c89b9c6039069217566ebcb60c9d0", "ja": "ああ、うん。\n今日は紬に、いい仕事の話をもってきたんだ。", "zh": "啊，嗯。\n今天我是来给紬带个好工作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "934942abddbba5530a1a726ee9426c3221af8da274fffbd79d7048641fd1bade", "ja": "なるほど。つまりあなたは日頃、いい仕事ではない\n話を私に持ってきていると……そういうことですか？", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，平时你带给我的，都是些不怎么样的工作……\n你是这个意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1017_p", "source_sha256": "cc52305ef0e69ebc9ab45b86bd2b3cbfbd65fecffe145862915b698f7c054afc", "ja": "そ、そうじゃなくて……今度、金沢で公演をする事に\nなったんだ。先方の希望で、センターは紬にって。", "zh": "不、不是那样……接下来要在金泽举行公演了。应对方的要求，由䌷担任中心位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "755576f6255cd03fda49ab22c2aec7f25a8215143a7437f41f478023bea01f82", "ja": "えっ……わ、私、ですか？", "zh": "诶……我、我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "5b1a5e987494f36236830cdce78b545727b3f943bcc65123406747cd9e466118", "ja": "金沢！　金沢って、紬の地元だよね？", "zh": "金泽！金泽就是紬的家乡吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1020_p", "source_sha256": "dc4826ec05a4d5386377bacf99d158239ff2f3c60afae4543f1a507d62d739ed", "ja": "ああ。金沢で様々な仕事をしてきた成果だな！\n紬にとっては、凱旋公演って事になるけど。", "zh": "啊。这是我们在金泽完成各种工作的成果啊！\n对纺来说，也算是凯旋公演了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "09d949f686897c47aa8e48a2eb20187eb017ec29796d55dc59ddb70c1f5311a1", "ja": "故郷でのライブ、ですか。\nそれは……真、特別なものになりますね。", "zh": "在家乡举办演唱会，是吗。\n那……确实会变得非比寻常呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "2b6a86d366886f9b16655dcaab10f79095a51c05f8caffcbad33af63663e93e0", "ja": "そうだねぇ。きっと紬さんの大切な人たちが、\nたくさん見に来てくれるんじゃないかい？", "zh": "是啊。纺小姐珍视的人们，一定会有很多人来看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1023_p", "source_sha256": "30472e192f967c8031fbdb6c5ec86b5422e09c01cd68f53998757e4cc3294b17", "ja": "うん。ご両親も喜んでくれるんじゃないかな。\n……紬、やってくれるか？", "zh": "嗯。你的父母应该也会很高兴吧。\n……紬，你愿意参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "213124e3c40afc0f8cecb15a2747c505fabcd5a1776ed110b119f3b5623f1ad4", "ja": "凱旋公演などと、自信をもって言えるほど、\n私はまだ結果を出していないように思いますが……。", "zh": "虽然还没取得足以让我自信地称之为凯旋公演的成果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "93c68dc8528da2e8cfdec72f5c8d5a379efc217db5c1cf6dfcc5e109e7ef55b9", "ja": "しかし……こうして指名いただいたからには、\n最善を尽くします。", "zh": "不过……既然您这样指定了我，我会竭尽全力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1026_p", "source_sha256": "1b1a8377524afe16d81bf26236776ca837dd7a20e4c94d8563581c6884082383", "ja": "よろしく頼む！　それと公演のスポンサーから、\n金沢での仕事の依頼が来ている。", "zh": "拜托你了！另外演出的赞助商那边，\n发来了在金泽的工作委托。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1027_p", "source_sha256": "05f576798a3ee5294fddff4d62500e276e223b796e5ed12b1d57a8355902854a", "ja": "今回の出演メンバー全員での、金沢レポだ。\nみんな、よろしくな！", "zh": "这是这次全体演出成员一起制作的金泽报道。\n大家，拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "5d7832b40ce76af8259a79735a64b43ae048b8868e25e7197670bac747a927cf", "ja": "本当ですか！？　ありさ、ようやく紬ちゃんに\n金沢を案内してもらえます～！", "zh": "真的吗！？阿利沙终于能让小紬带我游览金泽了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "1777b073e362fbdb8be05d505942aa77d6e1effb56033d032421b1a5ef4be389", "ja": "ねえねえ金沢ってさ、美味しいものたくさんあるよね？", "zh": "呐呐，金泽有很多好吃的东西，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3365a32c4edc214138ae91d6cfce2b3482558703d2e41164e8c50ddae7a6752c", "ja": "そうですね……たくさんありますが、\nやはり海が近いですから、海の幸は豊富かと。", "zh": "是啊……虽然有很多美味的东西，但毕竟靠近大海，海鲜应该很丰富。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1031_008tak", "source_sha256": "bb0775c122d9baba5898c51f388d089d2017ef2ec9db215121135736adc97281", "ja": "海の幸……それはまた甘美な響きですね……。\nぜひ、紬のおすすめを食べてみたいものです。", "zh": "海之珍馐……听起来真是令人陶醉……。\n真想尝尝紬推荐的美食。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f7e46a8c0cc1ddc2ebd0b9587a38f6f773bcd235aa220b9a0ee2c49c5fe2e190", "ja": "は、はい！　なかなかない機会ですから、\n時間が許せば、ぜひみなさんをご案内できればと。", "zh": "是、是的！毕竟是个难得的机会，要是时间允许的话，我很想带大家四处看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1033_p", "source_sha256": "43997426fe919f9f2ca8c581c76c38e7e61ed209f2d22a6592282f6821d71740", "ja": "そうだな。せっかくの機会だし、少し長めに\n自由時間をとれるよう、スケジュール調整するよ。", "zh": "是啊。难得有这样的机会，我会调整一下日程，尽量安排出长一点的自由时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1034_035hin", "source_sha256": "50c0a213f89c52cc167f0d9c4526aa027511b23e9bef8b794ba6c6e80b6aef40", "ja": "いいのかい？\nみんなで観光なんて、楽しみだわぁ。", "zh": "可以吗？\n能和大家一起去观光，好期待呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1035_p", "source_sha256": "043e489cf8ee67bf0a9502807e1df0c421d1536092a0099a7097c5b3aaa0261e", "ja": "けど、あくまで仕事だからな。\nしっかり頼んだぞ！", "zh": "不过，终究是工作。\n可要好好拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1036_null", "source_sha256": "fc770d561432a6428dfecb2d67b3bd153e6b292b7efe2c70840c3941bada3cf2", "ja": "1週間後、公演レッスン終了後……", "zh": "1周后，演出排练结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1037_035hin", "source_sha256": "e7155907a735555bedc27733938c02c54535bd190d4aa549bfa1adbd3f593a7b", "ja": "ふ～、今日もよく動いたべさ。\nそれじゃ紬さん、お先に失礼するよぉ。", "zh": "呼～今天也练得很卖力啊。\n那纺小姐，我就先走啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1038_043nor", "source_sha256": "12321747f14feba053210973a9d5d4923c09fc0b872efa0f841ab5095d472ef9", "ja": "明日はみんなで、金沢ロケでしょ？\n朝早いんだし、紬も早く帰りなよ！　じゃーね！", "zh": "明天大家要去金泽拍外景，对吧？早上还要早起，紬你也早点回去吧！拜拜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1039_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6e3bf0211622198fa5df3d2a14c154f4db49fae42d5b410163e363021275f992", "ja": "はい。お疲れ様でした。", "zh": "好的。辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1040_se", "source_sha256": "2601e0eabc299238374abea435a5db63a246aa4f2679b4d89e29569f0c942ce7", "ja": "バタン", "zh": "砰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1041_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a6490d8b89c4b42c7df0a05910a0582638ad215990a74bd682b236d0af5185d4", "ja": "はぁ……。\n凱旋公演なんて資格、うちにあるんやろか。", "zh": "唉……  \n我真的有资格举办凯旋公演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1043_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f48bf7bd0babb610ac77db57850e4f53b65abd0d5c2014c97c27033ca6946897", "ja": "！　な、なんやいね。\nこんな時間に、誰から……。学校？", "zh": "！怎、怎么回事啊……这么晚了，是谁打来的……学校？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1044_se", "source_sha256": "fab8835a5f8e3bdd4913bcb4e9a8ffa65e54a703681a2aec667ca24092cf0d0e", "ja": "ピッ", "zh": "嘀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1045_sensei", "source_sha256": "3dc115d6fb0d1fd1323cf0ae1e271a33922f86e070ffdf9a19c4404ec510b724", "ja": "「あ、こんばんは白石さん。……今、大丈夫かしら？」", "zh": "「啊，晚上好，白石小姐。……现在方便说话吗？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1046_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0b69a33f18361d134e9c0b3d88eb006084bf8942d1298144c743d3b760687dc4", "ja": "せ、先生……。\nはい、仕事は終わりましたので、問題ありません。", "zh": "老、老师……  \n嗯，工作已经结束了，没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1047_sensei", "source_sha256": "e3113f1a39d192a557ffd76a3074e0029be0a1fd01253ced559b03956d026b65", "ja": "「よかった。忙しいところごめんなさいね。\nその、進路調査票についてなんだけど……」", "zh": "“太好了。百忙之中打扰你真不好意思。\n那个，其实是关于志愿调查表的事……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1048_051tmg", "source_sha256": "657a2a03f525b8d670b6d5a236d120e870d279ea7c1cc88adc562eb8958a44d8", "ja": "あっ……も、申し訳ありません。\n提出日は把握していたのですが……。", "zh": "啊……真、真是非常抱歉。\n我知道提交日期……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1049_051tmg", "source_sha256": "434389384767d9d7ac73fee47dc3bb5b1b22a1eb4dde127443b3ebcc8755a7f4", "ja": "その……あともう少しだけ、\n考える時間をいただいてもよろしいでしょうか。", "zh": "那个……能不能再给我一点时间考虑？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1050_sensei", "source_sha256": "321e4e17e7e9da6f61f843ddd40ce76cb75b8d2ab00977bfa31c311ab7d9f793", "ja": "「わかりました。……悩んでいるようなら、\n早めに相談してくださいね？」", "zh": "“明白了……如果有什么烦恼，\n请尽早来找我商量哦？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1051_051tmg", "source_sha256": "41a0aca1be7a5cffa4e2634e8d4c521e71352eee44f4e5827307bef38ad64949", "ja": "は、はい……すみません。\nありがとうございます。……失礼いたします。", "zh": "是、是的……对不起。\n谢谢您……那我先告辞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1052_se", "source_sha256": "fab8835a5f8e3bdd4913bcb4e9a8ffa65e54a703681a2aec667ca24092cf0d0e", "ja": "ピッ", "zh": "嘀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_137_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_137_1053_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8eec6b2d28ab995c82671dd2a7a810563a06a53f1691677e0d49836630af2ff6", "ja": "家に帰って、お父さんと話を……。\n……。", "zh": "回到家，和爸爸谈谈……  \n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
